$MDESC::Type = "Tribes Arena";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Tribes Arena" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Jigor IV" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Who cares? Let's KILL!" @ 
         "\n<f1>Teams: <f0><vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1>" @
         "\n<f1>Author: <f0> LoRd*MoJo" @
         "\n<f1>Dedicated to: <f0> Penny-Arcade.com, for making Tribes just a joke!" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> A disturbance in the Treaty of Penny-Arcade has resulted in outbreak of war between <vServer::teamName0>, who are the disciples of Gabe, and <vServer::teamName1>, loyal to Tycho.  After many other battles of Capture the Flag, Defend and Destroy, and even Find and Retrieve, the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> have decided the only way to finish is a fight to the death!  The team with the last man standing wins the war and controls all of Penny-Arcade.  Who will win?  <vServer::teamName0> or <vServer::teamName1>?  Gabe or Tycho?  Well, only the Great Divx knows that mystery." @
         "\n\n<jc><f1> <f2> <f1> <f2> <f1> <f2> <f1> <f2>  Viva Penny-Arcade  <f1> <f2> <f1> <f2> <f1> <f2> <f1> <f2>";